---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /articles/
title: 文章主題
excerpt: 口袋營養獅營養師團隊撰寫的營養知識文章，依主題慢慢讀。
---
{%- import "macros.njk" as ui -%}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container">
    {{ ui.heading("ARTICLES", "文章主題", "營養師寫給你的日常健康讀本") }}
    <nav class="chips reveal" aria-label="閱讀主題">
      <a class="chip" href="/articles/" aria-current="page">全部</a>
      {%- for t in topics.topics %}<a class="chip" href="/topics/{{ t.slug }}/">{{ t.name }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid">
      {%- for item in collections.articles %}
      {{ ui.articleCard(item, topics.topics, collections.team) }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
